{"skill":{"slug":"getnote","displayName":"得到大脑（原 Get 笔记）"},"version":{"version":"2.3.1","createdAt":1792407388519,"changelog":"补齐录音台与录音卡来源查找说明，保留时间、分页、转写和授权范围；不改变接口与旧命令。","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":10249,"sha256":"c1276c4e4462926ed42ff7e5def5ea0b13a8abac0f875204b1d76ac0c10b6bad","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/auth.md","size":4894,"sha256":"1841f2ffcc3784730eb2470dfc3c3e3ba359612e520ae9eb37238a4dd637309c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/kb.md","size":17154,"sha256":"2af198a9dc6c434845c6a88fe3578f2f5caa4b566336c7f2015600938db194a8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/note.md","size":16637,"sha256":"0ae35c60493d61726781630176e60508bdf139312fe9af1f00ca4862a13cce91","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/search.md","size":13660,"sha256":"b9cbc3fab7cf7cb18c1b997ce260511c9f18d7867db2ebdd24e97d72e9256b43","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/tag.md","size":2844,"sha256":"619ee0cd5f39684224b69579aac6d4e62106e877a81c0e923cca8f3e2594b014","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2493,"sha256":"27a6bdff04f99968fc05b410279de8b2915ac080a233d2730c7f02c0ed8e8484","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1792407954977,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a71ceee2e53804811bc3095ede979a033d0e8216bc35feb9df99c6a974258509","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a71ceee2e53804811bc3095ede979a033d0e8216bc35feb9df99c6a974258509","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1792407714481},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":16,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1792407954977},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed GetNote/Dedao note-management skill that uses the official CLI to access and manage the user’s own notes with stated confirmation rules.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Browser authorization, local CLI configuration, remote API calls, and user-selected file uploads are proportionate to the integration; the artifact repeatedly says not to request, display, log, or pass full credentials in chat or command arguments.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package declares a platform-managed install of the @getnote/cli node package and explicitly avoids local install scripts or self-overwriting; setup/update may sync companion GetNote domain skills, but this is disclosed and tied to connection/update workflows.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Runtime instructions are narrowly routed to getnote CLI workflows, require real IDs and JSON success checks, and require confirmation for destructive or public actions; the documentation is Chinese-only, which is a usability/localization note rather than evidence of hidden behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Local auth state and CLI-managed skill sync are persistent effects, but they are disclosed; no hidden service, scheduler, shell-profile modification, tool hijack, or unrelated persistence was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill can read and modify remote note, knowledge-base, tag, upload, share, and delete-related data, but those capabilities match the stated note-management purpose and are disclosed in SKILL.md.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you intend to connect a GetNote/Dedao account and are comfortable with the official CLI storing local authorization and performing note reads/writes when you ask. Review setup/update prompts because they can install or sync CLI-managed companion skills, and confirm carefully before deletion, public sharing, broad tag replacement, or uploads.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: references/kb.md is Chinese-only, consistent with the Chinese-language GetNote/Dedao skill materials; it does not add hidden authority or unsafe behavior, though a language-preference note would improve clarity.\n[SQP-3] expected: references/note.md is Chinese-only, but the file’s operational content stays within disclosed note-management workflows and confirmation rules.\n[SQP-3] expected: references/search.md is Chinese-only, but it scopes searches, pagination, and private-content display rather than forcing unrelated behavior.\n[SQP-3] expected: references/tag.md is Chinese-only, but it limits tag operations to explicit user intent and verified tag IDs.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1792407954977}}}}}